    "power12943": "Psionic Charge Ardent Utility 2 Encounter ✦ Psionic Minor Action Ranged 10 Target : One ally Effect : When the target charges before the end of its next turn, it gains a +2 power bonus to speed and a power bonus to damage rolls equal to your Wisdom or Constitution modifier on the charge attack. Psionic Power, page(s) 12.",
