    "power9414": "Terrifying Visage Assassin Attack 1 Daily ✦ Fear , Implement , Psychic , Shadow Standard Action Close blast 5 Primary Target : One creature adjacent to you in the blast Primary Attack : Dexterity vs. Will Hit : 2d8 + Dexterity modifier psychic damage, and the primary target is immobilized (save ends). Miss : Half damage, and the primary target is immobilized until the end of your next turn. Effect : Make a secondary attack. Secondary Target : Each creature other than the primary target in the blast Secondary Attack : Dexterity vs. Will Hit : You push the secondary target 4 squares. Miss : You push the secondary target 2 squares. Dragon Magazine 379, page(s) 21.",
