    "power12563": "Converging Shadows Assassin Utility 2 Encounter ✦ Shadow Immediate Interrupt Personal Trigger : You are targeted by a melee or ranged attack Effect : You gain concealment until the end of your next turn. If the Triggering attack misses, you can make a Stealth check to hide. Dragon Magazine 388.",
    "power13800": "Distracting Illusion Assassin Utility 2 Encounter ✦ Illusion , Shadow Minor Action Close burst 10 Effect : You create the illusion of a Medium creature of your choice in an unoccupied square in the burst. The illusion is silent but moves and acts as though it was the creature it appears to be. Creatures that closely examine the illusion can make an Insight check to discover the illusion for what it really is. The check is opposed by a Bluff check that you make when you create the illusion. The illusion lasts until the end of your next turn. Sustain Minor : The illusion persists until the end of your next turn, and you can move it up to 6 squares. Heroes of Shadow, page(s) 24.",
    "power13801": "Silent Stalker Assassin Utility 2 At-Will ✦ Martial Move Action Personal Requirement : You must be hidden. Effect : You move up to your speed to a square within 2 squares of an enemy. You remain hidden until the end of this turn or until you make an attack. Heroes of Shadow, page(s) 24.",
    "power15914": "Smoke Bomb Assassin Utility 2 Encounter ✦ Shadow , Zone Immediate Reaction Close burst 1 Trigger : An enemy enters a square adjacent to you. Effect : The burst creates a lightly obscured zone that lasts until the end of your next turn. You can then shift up to your speed. Dragon Magazine 404.",
    "power12452": "Contrivance of Speed Assassin Utility 2 Daily ✦ Shadow , Stance Minor Action Effect : You enter the contrivance of speed stance. Until the stance ends, you can shift 2 squares as a move action. Dragon Magazine 386, page(s) 74.",
