    "power13803": "Ghost of the Rooftops Assassin Utility 6 At-Will ✦ Martial Move Action Personal Effect : You climb or make a long jump, moving a number of squares up to your speed, without making an Athletics check. Special : You can use this power only once per round. Heroes of Shadow, page(s) 25.",
