    "power9477": "Reaper in Black Assassin Attack 27 Encounter ✦ Fear , Implement , Psychic , Shadow Standard Action Ranged 5 Target : One creature Attack : Dexterity vs. Will Hit : 3d10 + Dexterity modifier psychic damage, and the target is immobilized until the end of your next turn. In addition, you slide each enemy within 5 squares of the target 1 square. Night Stalker : The number of squares you slide each enemy equals 3. Dragon Magazine 379, page(s) 37.",
