    "power1636": "Carving a Path of Light Astral Weapon Attack 11 Encounter ✦ Divine , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Strength vs. AC Hit : 2[W] + Strength modifier damage, and until the end of your next turn, your allies have combat advantage against any enemy adjacent to you. Player's Handbook, page(s) 100.",
    "power1635": "Pray for More Astral Weapon Utility 12 Encounter ✦ Divine Free Action Personal Effect : If you don't like the damage you have rolled with one of your attacks, reroll your damage. You must use the result of the second roll. Player's Handbook, page(s) 100.",
