    "power10056": "Always Falling Rage Barbarian Attack 1 Daily ✦ Primal , Rage , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Strength vs. AC Hit : 2[W] + Strength damage, and you knock the target prone. Miss : Half damage. Effect : You enter the rage of the Always Falling spirit. Until the rage ends, when one of your allies hits an enemy adjacent to you, you can shift 2 squares as an immediate reaction. Dragon Magazine 380, page(s) 34.",
