    "power14414": "Life-Ending Strike Barbarian Attack 1 Daily ✦ Primal , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Strength vs. AC Hit : 4[W] + Strength modifier damage. Miss : Half damage. Special : When charging, you can use this power in place of a melee basic attack. Heroes of the Feywild, page(s) 47.",
