    "power4880": "Rock Tree Rage Barbarian Attack 19 Daily ✦ Primal , Rage , Weapon Immediate Reaction Melee weapon Trigger : An enemy enters a square adjacent to you Target : The triggering enemy Attack : Strength vs. AC Hit : 5[W] + Strength modifier damage. Miss : Half damage. Effect : You enter the rage of the rock tree. Until the rage ends, when any enemy enters a square adjacent to you, you can make an opportunity attack against that enemy. In addition, if you are pulled, pushed, or slid, you can reduce the distance of the forced movement by 2 squares. Primal Power, page(s) 20.",
