    "power2625": "Feather Step Battlemind Utility 2 At-Will ✦ Psionic Move Action Personal Effect : Until the end of this turn, you ignore difficult terrain and can both move across liquid and stand on it as if it were solid ground. In addition, you move 3 squares. Player's Handbook 3, page(s) 46.",
