    "power13074": "Resolute Recovery Battlemind Utility 16 Daily ✦ Psionic Minor Action Personal Effect : You gain temporary hit points equal to your Constitution modifier + one-half your level and remove one effect that a save can end. You then shift 1 square. Psionic Power, page(s) 43.",
