    "power889": "Sacred Flame Cleric Attack 1 At-Will ✦ Divine , Implement , Radiant Standard Action Ranged 5 Target : One creature Attack : Wisdom vs. Reflex Hit : 1d6 + Wisdom modifier radiant damage, and one ally you can see chooses either to make a saving throw or to gain temporary hit points equal to your Charisma modifier + one-half your level. Level 21: 2d6 + Wisdom modifier radiant damage. Player's Handbook, page(s) 63, Class Compendium.",
