    "power488": "Divine Favor Cleric Utility 6 Daily ✦ Divine , Healing Standard Action Melee touch Target : You or one ally Effect : Until the end of the encounter, the target gains a +2 power bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls, and when the target is first bloodied, he or she can spend a healing surge. Divine Power, page(s) 34.",
