    "power935": "Knight of Glory Cleric Attack 19 Daily ✦ Conjuration , Divine , Implement Standard Action Ranged 10 Effect : You conjure a ghostly knight that occupies 1 square within range, and the knight makes the following melee attack. The knight lasts until the end of your next turn. You can move it up to 5 squares as a move action. Target : One creature adjacent to the ghostly knight Attack : Wisdom vs. AC Hit : 3d10 + Wisdom modifier damage. Sustain Minor : The knight persists, and it repeats the attack. Player's Handbook, page(s) 69, Class Compendium.",
