    "power3672": "Supernal Radiance Cleric Attack 19 Daily ✦ Divine , Implement , Radiant Standard Action Close burst 5 Target : Each enemy in the burst Attack : Wisdom vs. Will Hit : 2d10 + Wisdom modifier radiant damage. Effect : The target takes ongoing 10 radiant damage, cannot benefit from invisibility or concealment, and cannot become hidden (save ends all). Divine Power, page(s) 40.",
