    "power7117": "Heal Cleric Utility 22 Daily ✦ Divine , Healing Standard Action Melee touch Target : You or one ally Effect : The target regains all his or her hit points. Divine Power, page(s) 40, Heroes of the Fallen Lands, page(s) 105.",
    "power153": "Mass Cure Serious Wounds Cleric Utility 22 Daily ✦ Divine , Healing Standard Action Close burst 5 Target : You and each ally in the burst Effect : Each target regains hit points as if he or she had spent two healing surges. Divine Power, page(s) 40.",
    "power9990": "Prayer Made Real Cleric Utility 22 Daily ✦ Divine Minor Action Area burst 2 within 10 Target : You and each ally in the burst Effect : The target gains a +2 power bonus to saving throws. If you used healing word this turn, the target also gains a +2 power bonus to all defenses. If you used a Channel Divinity power since the start of your last turn, the target also gains a +1 power bonus to attack rolls. The effect lasts until the end of the encounter. Dragon Magazine 379, page(s) 57.",
    "power12416": "Prophetic Fervor Cleric Utility 22 Daily ✦ Divine No Action Close burst 5 Trigger : You roll initiative Target : You and each ally in the burst Effect : Each target gains a +2 bonus to the initiative check and temporary hit points equal to 10 + your Charisma modifier. Dragon Magazine 386, page(s) 40.",
