    "power3161": "Scattershot Daring Slinger Attack 11 Encounter ✦ Martial , Weapon Standard Action Ranged weapon Requirement : You must be wielding a sling. Target : One, two, or three creatures Attack : Dexterity vs. AC Hit : 3[W] + Dexterity modifier damage, and you push the target 1 square. Martial Power 2, page(s) 74.",
