    "power14039": "Constant Vigilance Dark Watcher Utility 12 Daily ✦ Healing , Shadow , Teleportation Immediate Reaction Close burst 10 Trigger : An ally within 10 squares of you drops to 0 hit points or fewer. Target : The triggering ally in the burst Effect : You teleport adjacent to the target, and the target can spend a healing surge. Heroes of Shadow, page(s) 142.",
    "power14038": "Righteous Disruption Dark Watcher Attack 20 Daily ✦ Shadow Standard Action Ranged 10 Target : One creature Effect : Your allies gain a +2 power bonus to attack rolls and a +5 power bonus to damage rolls against the target. In addition, the target takes a -2 penalty to attack rolls. These effects last until the end of the encounter. Heroes of Shadow, page(s) 142.",
    "power10356": "Vanishing Cut Darkening Blade Attack 11 Encounter ✦ Illusion , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Dexterity vs. AC Hit : 2[W] + Dexterity modifier damage, and you become invisible to the target until the end of your next turn Dragon Magazine 382, page(s) 70.",
    "power10358": "Gloaming Shroud Darkening Blade Utility 12 Encounter ✦ Illusion Free Action Personal Trigger : You miss with an attack Effect : You shift 3 squares and gain concealment until the end of your next turn. Dragon Magazine 382, page(s) 70.",
