    "power2738": "Wall of Stone Druid Utility 16 Daily ✦ Conjuration , Primal Standard Action Area wall 12 within 10 squares Effect : You conjure a wall of rough stone. The wall can be up to 6 squares high and must be on a solid surface. The wall is a solid obstacle. Each square of the wall has 100 hit points and crumbles into difficult terrain if it is destroyed. The whole wall crumbles into difficult terrain at the end of the encounter. Player's Handbook 2, page(s) 91.",
    "power14522": "Bloodthirsty Vines Druid Attack 17 Encounter ✦ Implement , Primal Standard Action Ranged 10 Target : One creature Attack : Wisdom vs. Reflex Hit : 3d10 + Wisdom modifier damage. Effect : You pull the target up to a number of squares equal to 2 + your Constitution or Dexterity modifier. Heroes of the Feywild, page(s) 82.",
