    "power8192": "Divine Excellence Feat Utility Encounter ✦ Divine Free Action Personal Channel Divinity : You can use only one channel divinity power per encounter Trigger : You make a skill check Effect : You gain a +2 power bonus to the skill check. Until the end of your next turn, you and each ally within 10 squares of you gain a +2 power bonus to checks using the same skill. Divine Power, page(s) 118.",
