    "power2170": "Moradin's Resolve Feat Utility Encounter ✦ Channel Divinity , Divine Minor Action Personal Effect : Until the end of your next turn, you gain a +2 bonus to attack rolls against Large or larger creatures. Special : You can use only one channel divinity power per encounter. Player's Handbook, page(s) 199, Class Compendium.",
