    "power5254": "Net Shield Feat Utility Encounter ✦ Weapon Minor Action Personal Requirement : You must be wielding a net. Effect : Until the start of your next turn, you gain a +2 power bonus to AC and Reflex defense. Dragon Magazine 368, page(s) 66.",
