    "power2173": "Raven Queen's Blessing Feat Utility Encounter ✦ Channel Divinity , Divine , Healing Free Action Ranged 10 Trigger : Your attack reduces an enemy within 10 squares of you to 0 hit points. Target : You or an ally within 5 squares of the enemy Effect : The target can spend a healing surge. Special : You can use only one channel divinity power per encounter. Player's Handbook, page(s) 200, Class Compendium.",
