    "power12660": "Defender Aura Fighter Utility At-Will ✦ Aura Minor Action Personal Effect : You activate an aura 1 that lasts until you end it as a minor action or until you fall unconscious. While in the aura, any enemy takes a -2 penalty to attack rolls when it makes an attack that does not include among its targets either you or an ally of yours who has this aura active. Marked enemies are not subject to this aura. Heroes of the Fallen Lands, page(s) 129, Heroes of the Forgotten Kingdoms, page(s) 124, Dragon Magazine 402, Heroes of the Feywild, page(s) 43.",
