    "power12695": "Single Out Fighter Utility 2 Encounter ✦ Fear , Martial Minor Action Ranged 5 Prerequisite : You must have training in Intimidate. Target : One enemy Effect : The target grants combat advantage to you until the end of your next turn. Heroes of the Fallen Lands, page(s) 156.",
