    "power2121": "Piquing Dare Fighter Attack 9 Daily ✦ Martial , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Strength vs. AC Hit : 3[W] + Strength modifier damage. If you have combat advantage against the target, the attack deals extra damage equal to your Dexterity modifier. Effect : The target is marked (save ends). If the target does not attack you on its turn while it is marked by this power, you can either make a melee basic attack against it or shift 1 square closer to it as a free action. Martial Power, page(s) 13.",
