    "power12679": "Defensive Advance Fighter Utility 10 Encounter ✦ Martial Move Action Personal Prerequisite : You must have training in Athletics. Effect : You gain a +2 power bonus to all defenses until the end of your next turn, and you shift up to your speed to a square adjacent to an enemy. Heroes of the Fallen Lands, page(s) 138.",
