    "power7391": "Phalanx Leader Fighter Utility 10 Encounter ✦ Martial Minor Action Personal Requirement : You must be using a shield. Effect : Until the end of your next turn, while any ally is adjacent to you, that ally gains a +2 shield bonus to AC and Reflex and you gain a +2 power bonus to melee attack rolls. PH Heroes: Series 2.",
    "power10516": "Steely Persuasion Fighter Utility 10 Encounter ✦ Martial Free Action Personal Trigger : You make an Intimidate check or a Streetwise check Requirement : You must be wielding a melee weapon. Effect : You gain a bonus to the skill check equal to the weapon's proficiency bonus plus the weapon's enhancement bonus. Martial Power 2, page(s) 14.",
