    "power10551": "Trollclaw Grip Fighter Attack 23 Encounter ✦ Martial , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Requirement : You must have a hand free. Target : One creature Primary Attack : Strength vs. AC Hit : 3[W] + Strength modifier damage. Effect : Make a secondary attack against the target. Secondary Attack : Strength vs. Reflex (unarmed) Hit : 1[W] + Strength modifier damage, and you grab the target. The target grants combat advantage until the grab ends. Martial Power 2, page(s) 19.",
