    "power1859": "Demonslayer's Hindrance Impilturan Demonslayer Attack 11 Encounter ✦ Martial , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One or two creatures Attack : Strength vs. AC (main weapon and off-hand weapon), two attacks Hit : 1[W] + Strength modifier damage per attack, and the target is slowed until the end of your next turn. If the target is a demon, it takes 2[W] + Strength modifier damage per attack, and it is immobilized until the end of your next turn. Forgotten Realms Player's Guide, page(s) 58.",
