    "power13015": "Incandescent Strike Incandescent Champion Attack 11 Encounter ✦ Augmentable , Psionic , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Charisma vs. AC Hit : 1[W] + Charisma modifier damage, and the target is blinded until the end of your next turn. Augment 2 Hit : 2[W] + Charisma modifier damage, and the target is blinded until the end of your next turn. Effect : Each enemy within 3 squares of you takes a -2 penalty to attack rolls until the end of your next turn. Psionic Power, page(s) 25.",
