    "power10878": "Prescient Thought Infernal Eye Utility 12 Daily ✦ Psionic Immediate Interrupt Close burst 10 Trigger : An ally in the burst misses with an attack or fails a skill check Effect : The ally gains a power bonus to the attack roll or skill check equal to your Charisma, Intelligence, or Wisdom modifier. Player's Handbook Races: Tiefling, page(s) 24.",
