    "power7208": "Word of Refuge Invoker Utility 16 Encounter ✦ Divine , Teleportation Immediate Interrupt Personal Trigger : An enemy makes an attack against you Effect : You negate the triggering enemy's attack against you and teleport 10 squares. You are dazed until the end of your next turn. If you were the only target of the triggering enemy's attack, the attacker can take a different action. Divine Power, page(s) 64.",
