    "power7204": "Confounding Utterance Invoker Utility 16 Daily ✦ Divine Minor Action Personal Effect : Until the end of the encounter, when any enemy makes a melee attack roll against you, it must roll twice and use the lower result. Divine Power, page(s) 64.",
