    "power3350": "Icon of Life Invoker Utility 16 Daily ✦ Divine , Zone Minor Action Area burst 5 within 20 squares Effect : The burst creates a zone of golden light that lasts until the end of the encounter. While within the zone, any ally gains a +5 bonus to death saving throws, and if the ally rolls a natural 20 on a death saving throw, that ally can spend two healing surges rather than one. Player's Handbook 2, page(s) 110.",
