    "power2868": "Vindicating Flames Invoker Attack 23 Encounter ✦ Divine , Fire , Implement Standard Action Area burst 2 within 10 squares Target : Each creature in the burst Attack : Wisdom vs. Reflex Hit : 2d6 + Wisdom modifier fire damage, and if the target moves before the end of your next turn, it takes 10 fire damage. Covenant of Wrath : If the target moves before the end of your next turn, the fire damage equals 10 + your Constitution modifier. Player's Handbook 2, page(s) 112.",
