    "power1597": "Frontline Surge Iron Vanguard Attack 11 Encounter ✦ Martial , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Strength vs. AC Hit : 2[W] + Strength modifier damage, and you can push the target 1 square. You can then shift 1 square toward the target. If you do so, each ally within 2 squares of you can shift 1 square as a free action. Player's Handbook, page(s) 86, Class Compendium.",
