    "power11456": "Fury of the Forge Master of the Forge Attack 20 Daily ✦ Divine , Fire , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Strength vs. AC Hit : 3[W] + Strength modifier fire damage, and ongoing 10 fire damage (save ends). Miss : Half damage, and ongoing 5 fire damage (save ends). Effect : Until the target saves against the ongoing fire damage, your allies deal 1d6 extra fire damage when they hit it with melee attacks. Player's Handbook 3, page(s) 114.",
