    "power7594": "Medani True Strike Medani Trueseer Attack 11 Encounter Standard Action Ranged 10 Effect : You can see invisible creatures within 10 squares of you and within your line of sight until you hit or miss with this power. Target : One creature Attack : Charisma or Wisdom + 4 vs. Reflex. The attack ignores any cover and any concealment if the target is within 10 squares of you. Hit : 2d10 + Charisma or Wisdom modifier. Eberron Player's Guide, page(s) 73.",
