    "power16578": "Lurking Spider Melee-Magthere Champion Utility Encounter ✦ Martial Immediate Reaction Personal Trigger : A creature within your reach hits you with an attack. Effect : The triggering creature is slowed until the end of its next turn, and you gain a +2 power bonus to all defenses until the end of your next turn. Council of Spiders, Dragon Magazine 413.",
