    "power7982": "End to Strife Messenger of Peace Attack 20 Daily ✦ Divine , Implement Standard Action Area burst 2 within 5 squares Target : Each enemy in the burst Attack : Wisdom vs. Will Hit : The target cannot attack until it is attacked or until the end of the encounter. Miss : The target takes a -5 penalty to attack rolls until it is attacked or until the end of the encounter. Divine Power, page(s) 49.",
