    "power16174": "Elemental Resilience Monk Utility 10 Encounter ✦ Elemental , Psionic Immediate Interrupt Personal Trigger : You take acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder damage. Effect : You gain resist 5 to the triggering damage type until the start of your next turn. Aftereffect : You gain resist 3 to the triggering damage type until the end of the encounter. Heroes of the Elemental Chaos, page(s) 77.",
