    "power12497": "Gift of Resistance Paladin Utility 22 Daily ✦ Divine , Stance Minor Action Personal Effect : You enter the gift of resistance stance. Until the stance ends, each ally within 5 squares of you has resistance 20 to any of the same damage types to which you have resistance. However, your enemies' attacks ignore all your resistances while you are in this stance. Dragon Magazine 387, page(s) 69.",
    "power13848": "Rampaging Bloodlust Paladin Utility 22 Daily ✦ Aura , Shadow Minor Action Personal Effect : You activate an aura 2 that lasts until the end of the encounter. Creatures other than you in the aura grant combat advantage. You and each ally in the aura gain a power bonus to damage rolls equal to twice the number of enemies in the aura. Heroes of Shadow, page(s) 48.",
    "power3293": "Return to the Living Paladin Utility 22 Daily ✦ Divine , Healing No Action Personal Trigger : You drop to 0 hit points or fewer and do not die Effect : You regain 1 hit point and can spend four healing surges. Divine Power, page(s) 92.",
    "power13579": "Shared Sacrifice Paladin Utility 22 Daily ✦ Aura , Divine Minor Action Personal Effect : You activate an aura 5 that lasts until the end of the encounter. Whenever you or an ally in the aura would spend a healing surge, you or an ally in the aura can lose a healing surge on that character's behalf so that he or she doesn't have to spend the surge. Heroes of the Forgotten Kingdoms, page(s) 143.",
