    "power15993": "Protective Scroll Runepriest Utility 10 Encounter ✦ Divine , Healing Minor Action Personal Effect : You spend a healing surge but regain no hit points. Instead, you create a palm-sized protective scroll that lasts until it is expended or until the end of your next extended rest. A creature carrying the scroll can use a minor action to expend the scroll and regain hit points equal to your healing surge value. The creature also gains a +5 power bonus to all defenses until the end of its next turn. Dragon Magazine 404.",
