    "power9551": "Intercepting Shot Seven Fates Archer Utility 12 Encounter ✦ Primal , Weapon Immediate Interrupt Ranged weapon Trigger : An enemy hits an ally adjacent to you with a ranged attack Target : The triggering enemy Effect : Make a ranged basic attack against the target with a –2 penalty to the attack roll. Your attack has no effect on the target, whether it hits or misses. However, if it hits, the ally gains a +5 bonus to all defenses against the triggering enemy's attack, and if that attack still hits, the ally takes only half damage from it. Player's Handbook 3, page(s) 132.",
