    "power5455": "Wind of Death and Mercy Shaman Attack 19 Daily ✦ Cold , Healing , Implement , Primal , Spirit Standard Action Melee spirit 1 Target : One creature Attack : Wisdom vs. Will Hit : 5d10 + Wisdom modifier cold damage. Miss : Half damage. Effect : The first ally to regain hit points while adjacent to your spirit companion regains 1d12 additional hit points. The second ally to do so regains 2d12 additional hit points, and the third ally to do so regains 3d12 additional hit points. This effect ends after the third ally regains these additional hit points or at the end of the encounter. Primal Power, page(s) 75.",
