    "power5552": "Natural Rebirth Shaman Utility 22 Encounter ✦ Healing , Primal Minor Action Close burst 20 Target : One dying ally in the burst Effect : The target regains hit points as if he or she had spent a healing surge. Until the end of the encounter, the target is immune to effects that immobilize, restrain, or slow. Primal Power, page(s) 75.",
