    "power5413": "Doorway to the Spirit World Shaman Utility 22 Daily ✦ Primal , Zone Minor Action Area burst 1 within 10 squares Effect : The burst creates a zone of primal energy that lasts until the end of the encounter. While within the zone, you and your allies are insubstantial. Player's Handbook 2, page(s) 129.",
    "power12882": "Sand Summons Shaman Utility 22 Daily ✦ Primal , Spirit , Teleportation , Zone Minor Action Close burst spirit 2 Target : Each ally in the burst Effect : Your spirit companion disappears. You teleport each target 5 squares. The burst creates a zone of difficult terrain that lasts until the end of the encounter. Dark Sun Campaign Setting, page(s) 93.",
