    "power5269": "Dancing Lightning Sorcerer Attack 3 Encounter ✦ Arcane , Implement , Lightning , Thunder Standard Action Ranged 10 Target : One creature Attack : Charisma vs. Reflex Hit : 2d10 + Charisma modifier lightning damage, and each creature adjacent to the target takes thunder damage equal to your Charisma modifier. Player's Handbook 2, page(s) 140.",
