    "power13445": "Vanishing Blade Swordmage Attack 1 Daily ✦ Arcane , Illusion , Teleportation , Weapon Standard Action Melee weapon Target : One creature Attack : Intelligence vs. AC Hit : 2[W] + Intelligence modifier damage, and the target is marked until the end of your next turn. Miss : Half damage. Effect : You teleport 5 squares and become invisible until the end of your next turn. Until the end of the encounter, whenever you hit an enemy with a melee attack, you may teleport 3 squares as a free action. Dragon Magazine 390.",
